<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>财富|财富</title><link>https://fortune.com</link><description>财富 500 强日报和突发商业新闻</description><lastBuildDate>Sun, 02 Aug 2026 12:54:13 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>“这真的不适合胆小的人”：这位29岁的CEO成为一名企业主，3年内收入翻倍，并学会了哪些车不能开</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/02/its-really-not-for-the-faint-of-heart-this-29-year-old-ceo-became-a-business-owner-doubled-revenue-in-3-years-and-learned-what-car-not-to-drive/</link><description>卢卡斯·飞利浦 (Lucas Philips) 26 岁时成为首席执行官，现在发现自己凌晨 4:30 起床，从曼哈顿通勤到纽瓦克。他没有桌上足球。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/lp.png?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 02 Aug 2026 11:30:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/02/its-really-not-for-the-faint-of-heart-this-29-year-old-ceo-became-a-business-owner-doubled-revenue-in-3-years-and-learned-what-car-not-to-drive/</guid></item><item><title>他 16 岁时无家可归。现在，他是大卫·贝克汉姆 (David Beckham) 健康公司的董事会成员，他的公司收入即将达到 10 亿美元</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/02/hudson-leogrande-comfrt-homeless-16-david-beckham-board-business-1-billion-revenue/</link><description>Hudson Leogrande 是流行连帽衫品牌 Comfrt 的创始人，在迈向企业家之路之前，他曾在汽车销售和烟囱电话营销之间徘徊。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/HudsonLeogrande-1-e1785527678167.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 02 Aug 2026 11:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/02/hudson-leogrande-comfrt-homeless-16-david-beckham-board-business-1-billion-revenue/</guid></item><item><title>SpaceX 创纪录的 IPO 正在帮助激发新一波旨在进入轨道的初创公司，并开辟地球以外的广阔新市场</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/02/spacex-ipo-wave-space-startups-fund-raising-commercial-market/</link><description>尽管 SpaceX 最近股价下跌，但专家表示，其创纪录的 IPO 正在为更多太空初创公司扫清道路。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Cosmoserve-Image-e1785509324665.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 02 Aug 2026 10:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/02/spacex-ipo-wave-space-startups-fund-raising-commercial-market/</guid></item><item><title>大多数亿万富翁都陷入了“缓慢的慈善事业”。麦肯齐·斯科特 (MacKenzie Scott) 捐赠 260 亿美元，直到“保险箱空了”才会停止</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/02/billionaires-slow-philanthropy-mackenzie-scott-stanford-essay/</link><description>大多数亿万富翁让自己的财富增长得比他们捐献的速度还要快。斯科特多年来一直在证明事情不必如此。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/GettyImages-2100039841-7-e1785521390797.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 02 Aug 2026 09:11:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/02/billionaires-slow-philanthropy-mackenzie-scott-stanford-essay/</guid></item><item><title>酒吧、保龄球馆和电影院的运行和参观成本太高。美国人已经没有地方可以闲逛，我们正在以健康为代价</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/02/bars-bowling-alleys-movie-theaters-affordabilitiy-third-space-health/</link><description>长期隔离对健康的影响与每天吸 15 支烟相同。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/GettyImages-1230814466-e1784926912844.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 02 Aug 2026 09:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/02/bars-bowling-alleys-movie-theaters-affordabilitiy-third-space-health/</guid></item><item><title>Crumbl 首席执行官表示，他周日会关门，并优先考虑与 7 个孩子一起玩游戏之夜，以追求平衡：生活不能只是“走、走、走”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/02/crumbl-cofounder-ceo-jason-mcgowan-work-life-balance-stores-closed-on-sunday-success-means-being-present/</link><description>Crumbl 联合创始人贾森·麦高恩 (Jason McGowan) 表示，他的摩门教信仰并不是他每年价值 10 亿美元的饼干帝国在周日关闭的唯一原因，这还与工作与生活的平衡有关。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Jason-Headshot-e1785438287852.png?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 02 Aug 2026 08:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/02/crumbl-cofounder-ceo-jason-mcgowan-work-life-balance-stores-closed-on-sunday-success-means-being-present/</guid></item><item><title>马姆达尼的市属超市将与没有城市曾经击败过的一股力量作斗争：市场</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/02/mamdani-city-owned-supermarkets-laws-of-economics/</link><description>市长耗资 7000 万美元的超市计划忽视了最初造成纽约食品荒漠的过时的分区法。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2287861112.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 02 Aug 2026 07:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/02/mamdani-city-owned-supermarkets-laws-of-economics/</guid></item><item><title>如果政府真的使用 SpaceAI，它可能成为东南亚对抗厄尔尼诺现象的优势</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/02/spaceai-could-be-southeast-asias-edge-against-el-nino-if-governments-actually-use-it/</link><description>SpaceAI——人工智能 (AI) 和空间技术的融合——可以帮助东南亚将原始数据转化为拯救生命等成果。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/GettyImages-2235383074-e1785518632344.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 02 Aug 2026 04:30:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/02/spaceai-could-be-southeast-asias-edge-against-el-nino-if-governments-actually-use-it/</guid></item><item><title>特朗普放弃对伊朗的新打击，声称中东盟友已经制定了重新开放霍尔木兹海峡的新协议的轮廓</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/01/trump-iran-strikes-mideast-allies-emerging-strait-of-hormuz/</link><description>他补充说，以色列已同意与美国一起致力于努力完成与伊朗的协议。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/AP26214075654183-e1785638448996.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 02 Aug 2026 02:47:35 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/01/trump-iran-strikes-mideast-allies-emerging-strait-of-hormuz/</guid></item><item><title>劳动力市场可能变得如此落后，以至于经济将不得不裁员以保持失业率稳定</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/01/the-labor-market-could-become-so-backward-that-the-economy-will-have-to-shed-jobs-to-keep-unemployment-steady/</link><description>“如今，劳动力市场的速度限制远低于几年前，为失业扩张奠定了基础。” &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2273897892-e1785621366556.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 01 Aug 2026 23:15:22 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/01/the-labor-market-could-become-so-backward-that-the-economy-will-have-to-shed-jobs-to-keep-unemployment-steady/</guid></item></channel></rss>